        --------
        ```python
        import zarr
        z = zarr.zeros(shape=(10000, 10000),
                        chunk_shape=(1000, 1000),
                        dtype="int32",)
        z.shape
        #> (10000, 10000)
        z.resize((20000, 1000))
        z.shape
        #> (20000, 1000)
        z.resize((50, 50))
        z.shape
        #>(50, 50)
        ```
